    <string name="full_shadow_card_title">What is full shadow</string>
    <string name="full_shadow_card_body">What is full shadow\n\nNormal shadow rewrites SELinux denials, leaving traces. Full shadow never touches SELinux - only DAC is bypassed.\n\nCost: paths denied by SELinux must go through /proc/sk/io.\n\nShell usage:\nprintf \&quot;read /path\&quot; | dd of=/proc/sk/io conv=notrunc\ncat /proc/sk/io\n\nprintf \&quot;list /path\&quot; | dd of=/proc/sk/io conv=notrunc\ncat /proc/sk/io</string>
