    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy &amp; compliance</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">This app has no network access and collects nothing.\n\n- No INTERNET permission, no analytics or crash-reporting SDK\n- Grants, modules and logs live only under /data/adb/umbral/ on this device\n- Logs are local files only and can be cleared from Settings\n- Uninstalling keeps /data/adb/umbral/; delete it manually for a full wipe\n\nKernel side: /proc/umbral and /proc/umbral_kmem exist in memory only.</string>
